I arrive at my station by metro.
The train doors open.
I step off the train.
I look around the station.
It is very crowded here on the platform.
I look for the way out.
I go towards the escalator.
I come down on the escalator.
Now I come onto the street.
I need to go near the sea.
My errand is right there.
There is a nice breeze outside here.
This breeze is a little humid and salty.
I can smell the sea.
The sea is right nearby from here.
I walk towards the sea.
I feel very nice.
